        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S40101, Stainless Steel Davos Tubular Entry Door Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Davos Stainless Steel Handleset has a modern feel that makes it great for contemporary spaces. It utilizes the clean lines and sharp corners of the ultra modern design aesthetic. This modern door handle has a brushed stainless steel finish. Choose your favorite trim, from square knobs to modern levers. The Davos Tubular Entry Door Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick. It is available as a dummy function and a single cylinder function.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/davos-tubular-handleset-emtek-4818\"><b>Brass Davos Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Davos Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Davos Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Height: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1”- 1-3⁄4”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 10-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-S40100-specifications.pdf?v=1704262357\"><b>Emtek S40101 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Davos Stainless Steel Handleset",
                "description": "The Davos Stainless Steel Handleset has a modern feel that makes it great for contemporary spaces. It utilizes the clean lines and sharp corners of the ultra modern design aesthetic. This modern door handle has a brushed stainless steel finish. Choose your favorite trim, from square knobs to modern levers. The Davos Tubular Entry Door Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick. It is available as a dummy function and a single cylinder function.",
